    id: "gen-2026-11-16-03",
    slug: "receipt-to-excel",
    title: "Receipt to Excel: Turn Paper Receipts Into a Spreadsheet",
    excerpt: "Turn a shoebox of paper receipts into a searchable spreadsheet. Here are three ways to convert receipts to Excel, and the workflow that keeps tax time painless.",
    featureImage: "/blog/receipt-to-excel.webp",
    author: "David Chen, CPA",
    tags: ["receipt to excel", "receipt scanner", "expense tracking", "receipts"],
